Output cch-demo.gif
Output cch-demo.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 21
Set Width 1200
Set Height 680
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Framerate 24

Hide
Type "cd /tmp/order-api && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "# every new project: rebuild .claude from scratch... again? 😩"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "cch load"
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 400ms
Down
Sleep 900ms
Escape
Sleep 600ms
Type "# whole templates in one keystroke. but 753 files? my context: 💀"
Enter
Sleep 900ms
Type "# go surgical instead:"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "cch search --tags stack:fastapi,task:review --limit 3"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type `cch compose --items "ECC/skills/fastapi-patterns,ECC/agents/security-reviewer.md"`
Enter
Sleep 1.8s
Type "# it grabbed the +1 dependency on its own 😎"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "# 4 files in. 98.6% context saved. tokens are for CODE."
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
